	/// Total count of all filter instances (report-level, page-level, and visual-level) across all reports. Each instance is one filter applied to one object in one location. Filter by 'Model Object Hierarchy'[Object Name] to see how many times a specific object is used as a filter.
	measure 'Filter Count' =
			CALCULATE(
			    [Report Objects Count],
			    KEEPFILTERS( 'All Reports'[Filter Type Group] <> "N/A" )
			)
